    "rating": 4,
    "highlight": "Perched on the prestigious Victoria Island and overlooking the breathtaking Eko Atlantic City and the Atlantic Ocean, Eko Hotels & Suites is West Africa&#39;s most iconic five-star destination. Our four distinctive properties — Eko Gardens, Eko Hotel, Eko Suites, and Eko Signature — offer an unmatched blend of comfort, elegance, and African warmth. Guests are treated to world-class dining across multiple restaurants, rejuvenating spa and recreational facilities, and sweeping ocean views that make every stay unforgettable. Just 10 minutes from the city centre, we are the perfect sanctuary for both the discerning business traveller and the leisure seeker. At Eko Hotels & Suites, luxury is not just a promise — it is the standard.",
