  {
    "name": "Lagos Continental Hotel",
    "rating": 5,
    "highlight": "With 358 elegantly appointed rooms, sweeping panoramic views of both the Atlantic Ocean and the Lagos skyline, and an award-winning dining scene spanning Italian, African, Continental, and rooftop poolside cuisines, every moment here feels extraordinary. Whether you&#39;re here to close a deal, celebrate a milestone, or simply escape, our world-class facilities and warm hospitality ensure your stay is nothing short of unforgettable",
    "description": "Lagos Continental Hotel is an award-winning five-star luxury hotel nestled in the heart of Victoria Island, Lagos. As West Africa&#39;s tallest hotel, it offers 358 elegant rooms, 37 suites, and a Presidential Suite, each thoughtfully designed for comfort, style, and breathtaking city or ocean views. Guests enjoy a rich dining experience across multiple restaurants and lounges, state-of-the-art meeting and event facilities, a fully equipped gym, and a vibrant rooftop pool. From intimate celebrations to large corporate gatherings, Lagos Continental delivers unrivalled hospitality at the highest international standards.",
