    "name": "Radisson Blu Anchorage Hotel",
    "rating": 4,
    "highlight": "Resting gracefully on the banks of Victoria Island with sweeping views of the Lagos Lagoon, the Radisson Blu Anchorage Hotel is where Scandinavian elegance meets the vibrant pulse of Africa. With its serene waterfront setting, award-winning dining, and an outdoor infinity pool that seems to merge with the lagoon itself, every glance outside your window is a postcard moment. This is Lagos luxury, beautifully anchored.",
    "description": "The Radisson Blu Anchorage Hotel is an award-winning five-star property located along the prestigious Ozumba Mbadiwe Road on Victoria Island, Lagos. Featuring 170 stylishly designed rooms and suites by Swedish designer Christian Lundwall, the hotel blends contemporary Scandinavian aesthetics with premium comfort. Guests enjoy a rich dining experience across the Voyage Restaurant, Surface Bar & Grill, and The View poolside bar, alongside a fully equipped fitness centre, spa, and outdoor infinity pool. With six versatile event spaces and a prime location close to Lagos&#39; key business and leisure districts, the Radisson Blu Anchorage is the ideal retreat for both the corporate traveller and the discerning leisure guest.",
